---
/**
 * 首页 V18 设计主体（英文）
 * 文案与 UI 架构移植自设计稿 Hitelecom-v18（已做多轮事实修正）。
 * - 样式：src/styles/home-v18.css（设计师原稿清理版，已加 .v18home 作用域隔离，Astro 管线哈希压缩）
 *         src/styles/home-v18-override.css（品牌蓝覆盖层 + 字体方案 B，后加载）
 * - 交互：src/scripts/home-v18.js（首屏轮播 / 产品选择器 / 部署架构图 / 询盘表单，Astro 管线打包）
 * - 图片：public/home-assets/img/，同名覆盖即可替换（首屏设备图待 H68 实拍替换）
 * - 滚动渐入使用全站约定 .reveal → .in（BaseLayout IntersectionObserver 统一驱动）
 */
---
<div class="v18home">
<section class="keynote-hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="keynote-title">
      <div class="keynote-stage" id="keynote-stage" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Hitelecom product and platform highlights">
        <article class="keynote-slide is-active" data-keynote-slide="0" data-goto="#products" role="link" tabindex="0" aria-label="Show the product portfolio section" aria-hidden="false">
          <picture>
            <source media="(max-width: 760px)" type="image/avif" srcset="/home-assets/img/hero-devices-m-1200-v9.avif" width="1200" height="900">
            <source media="(max-width: 760px)" type="image/jpeg" srcset="/home-assets/img/hero-devices-m-1200-v9.jpg" width="1200" height="900">
            <source type="image/avif" sizes="100vw"
                    srcset="/home-assets/img/hero-devices-1920-v10.avif 1920w, /home-assets/img/hero-devices-2560-v10.avif 2560w">
            <img src="/home-assets/img/hero-devices-2560-v10.jpg"
                 srcset="/home-assets/img/hero-devices-1920-v10.jpg 1920w, /home-assets/img/hero-devices-2560-v10.jpg 2560w"
                 sizes="100vw"
                 alt="Hitelecom industrial IoT sensors and gateways above a connected digital globe"
                 width="2560" height="1440" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" draggable="false">
          </picture>
          <div class="keynote-copy">
            <h1 id="keynote-title">Sense the Physical World.</h1>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="keynote-slide" data-keynote-slide="1" data-goto="#software" role="link" tabindex="0" aria-label="Show the IoT cloud deployment section" aria-hidden="true">
          <picture>
            <source media="(max-width: 760px)" type="image/avif" srcset="/home-assets/img/hero-platform-m-1200-v10.avif" width="1200" height="900">
            <source media="(max-width: 760px)" type="image/jpeg" srcset="/home-assets/img/hero-platform-m-1200-v10.jpg" width="1200" height="900">
            <source type="image/avif" sizes="100vw"
                    srcset="/home-assets/img/hero-platform-1920-v11.avif 1920w, /home-assets/img/hero-platform-2560-v11.avif 2560w">
            <img src="/home-assets/img/hero-platform-2560-v11.jpg"
                 srcset="/home-assets/img/hero-platform-1920-v11.jpg 1920w, /home-assets/img/hero-platform-2560-v11.jpg 2560w"
                 sizes="100vw"
                 alt="Hitelecom IoT dashboard and mobile application connected over a digital globe"
                 width="2560" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false">
          </picture>
          <div class="keynote-copy">
            <h2 class="keynote-headline">Build Your IoT World.</h2>
          </div>
        </article>

        <div class="keynote-controls" role="group" aria-label="Choose hero slide">
          <button class="keynote-dot" type="button" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Show industrial IoT devices" data-keynote-target="0"></button>
          <button class="keynote-dot" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Show IoT platform" data-keynote-target="1"></button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="keynote-bridge">
        <div class="keynote-bridge-copy">
          <p>Hitelecom I<span class="keep-case">o</span>T Devices · Cloud · Apps</p>
          <h2>Ultra-low power. <br>Flexible connectivity. <br>Your platform or ours.</h2>
          <p>Choose a field-ready terminal or work with us to create a dedicated device with 4G, NB-IoT, LoRa, or LoRaWAN connectivity.</p>
          <div class="keynote-bridge-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="#contact">Start an inquiry</a>
            <a class="text-link" href="#products">Explore devices <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="keynote-trust">
          <div class="keynote-value-grid" aria-label="Hitelecom product, connectivity and factory proof">
            <div><strong>Sensors</strong><span>50+ industrial-grade IoT terminals</span></div>
            <div><strong>Cloud</strong><span>Private or public, your cloud or ours.</span></div>
            <div><strong>Mobile Apps</strong><span>Monitor devices, receive configured alerts, and act from anywhere</span></div>
            <div class="manufacturing-system-cell"><strong>OEM / ODM</strong><span>Enclosure, firmware and branding</span><span>ISO 9001 · ISO 14001 · ISO 45001 Certified</span></div>
          </div>
          <p class="keynote-trust-note">Certifications and product approvals depend on the facility, model, radio configuration and target market.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>



    <div class="product-module">
<section class="sec lt" id="products">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="product-homepage-heading">
