        <h2>Choose what <br>to sense.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lead">Hitelecom offers sensing terminals for temperature, humidity, pressure, air quality, tilt, vibration, and more.</p>
    </div>
    <input type="radio" name="fam" id="f1" class="famr" checked>
<input type="radio" name="fam" id="f2" class="famr">
<input type="radio" name="fam" id="f3" class="famr">
<input type="radio" name="fam" id="f4" class="famr">
<input type="radio" name="fam" id="f5" class="famr">
<input type="radio" name="fam" id="f6" class="famr">
<input type="radio" name="fam" id="f7" class="famr">
<input type="radio" name="fam" id="f8" class="famr">
<input type="radio" name="fam" id="f9" class="famr">
<input type="radio" name="fam" id="f10" class="famr">
<input type="radio" name="fam" id="f11" class="famr">
<input type="radio" name="fam" id="f12" class="famr">
    <div class="cfg">
      <div class="stagebox">
        <article class="stage s1"><div class="st-info"><p class="st-eyebrow">Sensor family 01 / 12</p><h3>Industrial Temperature Sensors</h3><p class="st-desc">PT1000-class terminals for process lines, plant rooms and cold stores.</p><div class="chips"><span>−200°C to +800°C</span><span>±0.5°C</span><span>18 models</span></div><p class="st-proto">4G · NB-IoT · LoRa · Custom</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary sm" href="#contact" data-fam="Industrial Temperature Sensors">Request pricing <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="st-detail" href="/product/temperature-sensor">View product details <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="st-shot"><img src="/home-assets/img/product-01-industrial-temperature.webp" alt="Hitelecom industrial temperature sensors — wireless IoT sensing terminal" width="478" height="820" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article>
<article class="stage s2"><div class="st-info"><p class="st-eyebrow">Sensor family 02 / 12</p><h3>Temperature & Humidity Sensors</h3><p class="st-desc">Climate terminals for clean rooms, cabinets, museums and lines.</p><div class="chips"><span>0–100% RH</span><span>±0.2°C</span></div><p class="st-proto">4G · NB-IoT · LoRa · Custom</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary sm" href="#contact" data-fam="Temperature & Humidity Sensors">Request pricing <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="st-detail" href="/product/temperature-humidity-sensor">View product details <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="st-shot"><img src="/home-assets/img/product-02-temp-humidity.webp" alt="Hitelecom temperature & humidity sensors — wireless IoT sensing terminal" width="820" height="684" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article>
<article class="stage s3"><div class="st-info"><p class="st-eyebrow">Sensor family 03 / 12</p><h3>Temperature & Humidity Data Loggers</h3><p class="st-desc">Audit-ready records for cold chain, pharma and food transport.</p><div class="chips"><span>80,000 readings</span><span>±0.2°C</span></div><p class="st-proto">NFC · Local USB · Custom</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary sm" href="#contact" data-fam="Temperature & Humidity Data Loggers">Request pricing <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="st-detail" href="/product/temperature-humidity-data-logger">View product details <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="st-shot"><img src="/home-assets/img/product-03-th-data-logger.webp" alt="Hitelecom temperature and humidity data logger with NFC configuration and USB export" width="820" height="517" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article>
<article class="stage s4"><div class="st-info"><p class="st-eyebrow">Sensor family 04 / 12</p><h3>Air Quality Sensors</h3><p class="st-desc">Multi-parameter sensing in one head — PM, CO₂, temperature, humidity and more.</p><div class="chips"><span>6-in-1</span><span>CO₂ to 5,000 ppm</span></div><p class="st-proto">4G · NB-IoT · LoRa · Custom</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary sm" href="#contact" data-fam="Air Quality Sensors">Request pricing <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="st-detail" href="/product/air-quality-sensor">View product details <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="st-shot"><img src="/home-assets/img/product-04-air-quality.webp" alt="Hitelecom air quality sensors — wireless IoT sensing terminal" width="521" height="820" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article>
<article class="stage s5"><div class="st-info"><p class="st-eyebrow">Sensor family 05 / 12</p><h3>TVOC Sensors</h3><p class="st-desc">Fixed-mount VOC monitoring for paint shops, chemical stores and labs.</p><div class="chips"><span>0–100,000 ppb</span><span>1 ppb resolution</span></div><p class="st-proto">4G · NB-IoT · LoRa · Custom</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary sm" href="#contact" data-fam="TVOC Sensors">Request pricing <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="st-detail" href="/product/tvoc-sensor">View product details <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="st-shot"><img src="/home-assets/img/product-05-tvoc.webp" alt="Hitelecom TVOC sensors — wireless IoT sensing terminal" width="750" height="820" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article>
<article class="stage s6"><div class="st-info"><p class="st-eyebrow">Sensor family 06 / 12</p><h3>Pressure Sensors</h3><p class="st-desc">Gauge and absolute pressure sensing for pipelines, tanks, wells and hydraulic systems.</p><div class="chips"><span>0–20 MPa</span><span>IP67 or IP68</span><span>30+ models</span></div><p class="st-proto">4G · NB-IoT · LoRa · Custom</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary sm" href="#contact" data-fam="Pressure Sensors">Request pricing <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="st-detail" href="/product/pressure-sensor">View product details <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="st-shot"><img src="/home-assets/img/product-06-pressure.webp" alt="Hitelecom pressure sensors — wireless IoT sensing terminal" width="458" height="820" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article>
<article class="stage s7"><div class="st-info"><p class="st-eyebrow">Sensor family 07 / 12</p><h3>Soil Sensors</h3><p class="st-desc">Soil moisture, temperature, conductivity and nutrient monitoring for agriculture and environmental sites.</p><div class="chips"><span>NPK option</span><span>IP67 or IP68</span></div><p class="st-proto">4G · NB-IoT · LoRa · Custom</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary sm" href="#contact" data-fam="Soil Sensors">Request pricing <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="st-detail" href="/product/soil-moisture-sensor">View product details <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="st-shot"><img src="/home-assets/img/product-07-soil.webp" alt="Hitelecom soil sensors — wireless IoT sensing terminal" width="553" height="820" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article>
