<article class="stage s9"><div class="st-info"><p class="st-eyebrow">Sensor family 09 / 12</p><h3>Vibration Sensors</h3><p class="st-desc">Structural vibration monitoring for heritage buildings, bridges, tunnels and railway infrastructure.</p><div class="chips"><span>0–100 mm/s</span><span>±1% at 80 Hz</span></div><p class="st-proto">4G · NB-IoT · LoRa · Custom</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary sm" href="#contact" data-fam="Vibration Sensors">Request pricing <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="st-detail" href="/product/vibration-sensor">View product details <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="st-shot"><img src="/home-assets/img/product-09-vibration.webp" alt="Hitelecom vibration sensors — wireless IoT sensing terminal" width="642" height="820" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article>
<article class="stage s10"><div class="st-info"><p class="st-eyebrow">Sensor family 10 / 12</p><h3>Radar Distance Sensors</h3><p class="st-desc">Non-contact distance measurement for tanks, silos, rivers and open bins.</p><div class="chips"><span>0.3–50 m</span><span>mm-class accuracy</span></div><p class="st-proto">4G · NB-IoT · LoRa · Custom</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary sm" href="#contact" data-fam="Radar Distance Sensors">Request pricing <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="st-detail" href="/product/radar-distance-sensor">View product details <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="st-shot"><img src="/home-assets/img/product-10-radar-distance.webp" alt="Hitelecom radar distance sensors — wireless IoT sensing terminal" width="520" height="820" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article>
<article class="stage s11"><div class="st-info"><p class="st-eyebrow">Sensor family 11 / 12</p><h3>Asset Tracking Sensors</h3><p class="st-desc">Find pallets, tools and returnable crates across sites.</p><div class="chips"><span>GPS · BeiDou · LBS</span><span>Multi-year battery</span></div><p class="st-proto">4G · NB-IoT · LoRa · Custom</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary sm" href="#contact" data-fam="Asset Tracking Sensors">Request pricing <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="st-detail" href="/product/asset-tracking-sensor">View product details <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="st-shot"><img src="/home-assets/img/product-11-asset-tracking.webp" alt="Hitelecom asset tracking sensors — wireless IoT sensing terminal" width="820" height="516" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article>
<article class="stage s12"><div class="st-info"><p class="st-eyebrow">Sensor family 12 / 12</p><h3>Custom Gas Sensors</h3><p class="st-desc">Pick the gas — we build the terminal around it.</p><div class="chips"><span>100+ gases</span><span>Fixed or ducted</span></div><p class="st-proto">4G · NB-IoT · LoRa · Custom</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary sm" href="#contact" data-fam="Custom Gas Sensors">Request pricing <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="st-detail" href="/product/custom-gas-sensor">View product details <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="st-shot"><img src="/home-assets/img/product-12-custom-gas.webp" alt="Hitelecom custom gas sensors — wireless IoT sensing terminal" width="746" height="820" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article>
      </div>
      <div class="fam-grid" role="group" aria-label="Product families">
        <div class="product-picker-heading"><strong>Product families</strong><span>Select to configure</span></div>
        <label class="fam-card" for="f1"><b>Industrial Temperature Sensors</b><span>−200°C to +800°C</span></label>
<label class="fam-card" for="f2"><b>Temperature & Humidity Sensors</b><span>0–100% RH</span></label>
