</div>

    <section class="section hardware-features-section content-auto" id="hardware" aria-labelledby="hardware-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hardware-feature-heading reveal">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Industrial design</p>
            <h2 class="section-title" id="hardware-title">Designed for years. <br>Built for the elements.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Low-power architectures and environmental protection are configured for the deployment—not copied from a generic specification sheet.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hardware-feature-grid">
          <article class="hardware-feature-card power-feature-card reveal">
            <div class="feature-copy">
              <p class="feature-kicker">Power</p>
              <h3>Up to a decade. <br>On one cell.</h3>
              <p>Selected battery-powered sensor terminals combine deep sleep, adaptive sampling and configurable reporting to extend time in the field.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="power-visual" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="battery-assembly">
                <div class="battery-shell"><div class="battery-fill"><span>10 yr</span></div></div>
                <div class="battery-timeline"><span>Y3</span><span>Y6</span><span>Y10</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <dl class="feature-specs">
              <div><dt>Up to 10 yr*</dt><dd>Battery life</dd></div>
              <div><dt>µA-class</dt><dd>Sleep current</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Reported</dt><dd>Battery health</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <p class="feature-footnote">* Selected configurations. Actual runtime varies with reporting interval, network conditions, battery chemistry and temperature.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="hardware-feature-card protection-feature-card reveal">
            <div class="protection-media">
              <img src="/home-assets/img/protection-immersion-1586-v2.webp" srcset="/home-assets/img/protection-immersion-1024-v2.webp 1024w, /home-assets/img/protection-immersion-1586-v2.webp 1586w" sizes="(max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 620px" alt="Hitelecom industrial IoT enclosure half-submerged in a controlled water-protection test" width="1586" height="992" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            </div>
            <div class="feature-copy">
              <p class="feature-kicker">Protection</p>
              <h3>Built for the elements.</h3>
              <p>Sealing and cable interfaces can be engineered for immersion or high-pressure washdown, then validated on the final configuration.</p>
              <dl class="feature-specs">
                <div><dt>IP68*</dt><dd>Immersion option</dd></div>
                <div><dt>IP69K*</dt><dd>Washdown option</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Custom</dt><dd>Interfaces &amp; mounting</dd></div>
              </dl>
              <p class="feature-footnote">* Available on request. Protection rating depends on the final product configuration and validation.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="hardware-feature-cta reveal">
          <p>Start from a proven terminal or build a dedicated device. We align the sensing, wireless, power, enclosure, firmware, mounting, and protection design with the site requirements.</p>
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#contact">Discuss your project</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section software-section content-auto" id="software" aria-labelledby="software-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="software-top reveal">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Flexible deployment</p>
            <h2 class="section-title" id="software-title">Your cloud. <br>Or ours.</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">Private infrastructure, Hitelecom Cloud or direct integration with the platform you already operate.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="deployment-options" aria-label="Highlight deployment architecture">
            <button class="deployment-option" type="button" data-network-mode="private" aria-pressed="true">
              <span class="option-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span><strong>Private deployment</strong><small>LoRa / LoRaWAN gateway to your server</small></span>
              <svg class="option-arrow" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11M11 6l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </button>
            <button class="deployment-option" type="button" data-network-mode="public" aria-pressed="false">
              <span class="option-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M7 18a4 4 0 0 1 .8-7.9A5.4 5.4 0 0 1 18.3 11 3.5 3.5 0 0 1 18 18H7Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="M12 13v5m0-5-2 2m2-2 2 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span><strong>Public cloud</strong><small>4G / NB-IoT to customer or Hitelecom Cloud</small></span>
              <svg class="option-arrow" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11M11 6l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </button>
            <button class="deployment-option" type="button" data-network-mode="integrate" aria-pressed="false">
              <span class="option-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="m8 8-4 4 4 4m8-8 4 4-4 4M14 5l-4 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span><strong>Your existing platform</strong><small>API, MQTT and configurable data models</small></span>
              <svg class="option-arrow" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11M11 6l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="network-card reveal">
          <div class="network-toolbar">
            <strong>Flexible IoT deployment architecture</strong>
